The Zorbon is a supposed entity that controls the minds of the unsuspecting. His machinations can be repelled by tinfoil, and so those that try to avoid his influence fashion clothing, like hats, out of foil. He's been described has having fungal qualities.

It's believed that the Zorbon is somehow related to [[Benjamin Grayson|Grayson]], the CEO of [[Org/Amber Call/index|Amber Call]].

When a clear night over [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]] turned to a downpour that did not stop, the party's first thought was the Zorbon. Those who would know say the Zorbon could cause weather like that, but that [[Mr. Whiskers]] is the one to ask. A group called the [[Anti-Zorbon Taskforce]] meets in the sewers beneath [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Widdershins/index|Widdershins]] to work against him.
